      "titre": "File:10-СТРУКТУРА-БЕТОНА-3.jpg",
      "description": "It's concrete! In the photo the structure of high-strength concrete SISTROM. Cement stone white around the particles of sand. The strength of cement stone up to 150 MPa. The strength of the contact cement with sand is higher than the strength of the sand grains, so the grain of sand is cut by the destruction of the concrete. Even if the sand particles are granite or quartz. It is known that the sand contains large amounts of minerals. Thus we can study the structure of minerals or ancient shellfish (that are seen in the photo) using cement SISTROM.",
